  "definition_ja": "同じ数や文字をいくつか掛け合わせたもの。a を n 個掛け合わせたものを a の n 乗といい、aⁿ と書く。",
  "definition_en": "A product in which the same number is used as a factor again and again, written with an exponent. For example, 2 · 2 · 2 = 2³ is the third power of 2.",
